From 36717ab7ecfcd3e2262580c6c3b56d68a67d4929 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: pseudo <cdodge@pseudoseed.com>
Date: Mon, 31 Aug 2026 02:07:28 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 24/33] [Spec 250][Phase: phase_9] fix: the sidebar toggle sat
 on the first pane's title at 390
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Caught in the screenshot, not by a test — the shell's floating sidebar toggle
overlaps the top-left of the content area, and with no header on this route it
landed on the first pane's own 'architect/' label.

A header row clears it at every width and names the page, which seven unlabelled
cards otherwise leave a reader to infer. The mobile inset is on the header rather
than on the grid, so the panes keep the full width the geometry measured.

Also shortens the messages placeholder: the same three-line sentence repeated in
seven panes was most of the screen's text. It still says what is true and what
publishes it, in one line, and the footer's Open link was already the affordance
the long version was spelling out.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 apps/web/src/codev/BuilderPane.tsx           |  3 +--
 apps/web/src/routes/_chat.codev-builders.tsx | 14 ++++++++++++++
 2 files changed, 15 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/apps/web/src/codev/BuilderPane.tsx b/apps/web/src/codev/BuilderPane.tsx
index 3c5c535c4..8ccf51a55 100644
--- a/apps/web/src/codev/BuilderPane.tsx
+++ b/apps/web/src/codev/BuilderPane.tsx
@@ -123,8 +123,7 @@ export function BuilderPane(props: {
           which is a claim about the builder rather than about what reached the
           browser — and it would be wrong.
         */}
-        Recent messages come from codev-agent, which this page does not read yet. Open the thread
-        to read them now.
+        Messages not read here yet — published by codev-agent.
       </div>
 
       <footer className="flex min-w-0 items-baseline gap-2 text-[13px] text-muted-foreground">
